\newlabel{fig1}{{1}{3}{System Architecture Overview: End-to-end pipeline of Self-Normalized Phase-Space Adaptive Moving Average (PSAMA). Noisy input series feeds into rolling MAD normalization and gradient volatility computation, dynamically modulating sliding window sizing between 1 and 5 points before final adaptive prediction}{figure.1}{}}
